  m_text: '<b>Demo 2 - Placing on GripTarget (Non-Physical)</b>

    SCARA places
    MUs onto a GripTarget on a moving table.

    The MU becomes a child of the table
    and moves with it.

    Demonstrates sub-parenting behavior.'
